    "created_at": "2022-05-31T18:26:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-31T18:26:04Z",
    "body": "If the HTML/CSS specs need to support no-cors fetches, then they also need access to the response body... \r\nAs long as the bytes are not exposed directly to the web developer, I don't see what's missing and how another warning would add to the current documentation of what opaque responses are about...",
